WEBVTT

00:01:57.970 --> 00:01:59.760
﻿An Amerian Mobile Armor?

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:07.190
﻿G-Self, do you read me?

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:09.940
﻿Head into the shadow of the island in
﻿the direction the Armorzagan came from!

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:14.740
﻿Chuchumy.

00:02:14.740 --> 00:02:16.870
﻿Go sit in back.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.910
﻿He's flying well.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:24.040
﻿Huh? My Jahannam's been abandoned here.

00:02:40.930 --> 00:02:43.060
﻿Supplies from the mainland, huh?

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:47.480
﻿You try using the Jahannam.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.360
﻿What?!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:49.520
﻿Chuchumy.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:51.400
﻿- Not you!
- ﻿No!

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:57.320
﻿Did Lieutenant Klim lose his armaments?

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.160
﻿Lieutenant, I've brought weapons!

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.580
﻿Inspector General? You came here?!

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.710
﻿Chuchumy!

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:10.960
﻿G! G! Bell!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:12.670
﻿- Bell!
- ﻿Don't open the Jahannam's hatch!

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:15.050
﻿- It's already open.
- ﻿Fine then!

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:17.840
﻿Raraiya!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.590
﻿The enemy's tough!

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:22.310
﻿Anything you can do, we can do too!

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.900
﻿Those pilots are awesome.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:32.690
﻿Father!

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.400
﻿Oh, I'm glad to see you're well.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:35.860
﻿Father?"

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:37.450
﻿Chuchumy!

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:38.780
﻿She's cute, huh?

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.030
﻿Cute.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.660
﻿Her father...

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:43.740
﻿Isn't he the Amerian
﻿Army's Inspector General?

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.410
﻿He's supposed to be the guy at the top.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.960
﻿The Arcane fell into the sea?

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:51.080
﻿I still can't make full
﻿use of its capabilities.

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:52.460
﻿Did someone save you?

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.420
﻿Yes.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.760
﻿What are you doing here at the front lines?

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:57.170
﻿You're asking why?

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.720
﻿You must be Bellri Zenam.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:08.980
﻿Oh, I'm not going to join the Amerian Army.

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:10.230
﻿I don't mind.

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:13.820
﻿Let us switch out backpacks for you.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:17.990
﻿Goetz, have the Jahannam go on lookout
﻿at the top of the mountain!

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:20.070
﻿Roger! I will—

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:21.490
﻿Hurry up and go!

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:24.120
﻿We cannot leave everything
﻿to just one Armorzagan!

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:34.880
﻿We will hold out until the G-Self comes!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.420
﻿I'm counting on you!

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:39.050
﻿Lieutenant, but the Montero is—

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.430
﻿Fresh water is pretty.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.140
﻿I can believe that

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:50.270
﻿For engineers, it's the truth.

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:54.900
﻿Use the external control panel
﻿with the G-Self's hands!

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:56.230
﻿What?!

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.110
﻿I can't do it from the cockpit?!

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.450
﻿The connectors match, right?

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:01.910
﻿Well, it looks like they should!

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:04.530
﻿Hurry up, Bellri Zenam.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.490
﻿Take another half-step back!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.660
﻿Okay! Bellri, was it? Don't come forward!

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.170
﻿Okay, next!

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:21.970
﻿Okay, final form!

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:27.810
﻿Got it! There's beams and missiles.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:31.480
﻿What's this about the armor's
﻿flash attack and color shifting?

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:33.020
﻿I'm falling here!

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:34.100
﻿B-But...

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.310
﻿My legs!

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:39.070
﻿You can get down using the
wire your leg just brushed.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:45.780
﻿Are you all right?

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.240
﻿I'm fine!

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:50.040
﻿The Tricky Backpack unfurls behind you.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:54.750
﻿Raraiya!

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:08.600
﻿Inspector General Gusion,
﻿look after Raraiya for me.

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.060
﻿Bell, here's a rifle.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:16.690
﻿It took off.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.440
﻿Because it's using the Tricky Pack.

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:21.690
﻿Can you stay calm over there, Raraiya?

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.330
﻿There's no way.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.790
﻿Aida, protect your father.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:34.790
﻿I've gotten a little more used
﻿to it. I'm flying, aren't I?

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:40.130
﻿You're getting in the way.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.420
﻿Father!

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:50.430
﻿The Arcane is here to guard us.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:21.710
﻿I won't let those gangly insects
﻿get behind the Armorzagan!

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.130
﻿Lieutenant, you're taking too long!

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.880
﻿My apologies. This solo-flyer delayed me!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.640
﻿Did he target me?!

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.180
﻿I need to withdraw!

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:40.230
﻿Arbokas got taken out?

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:44.150
﻿Did that Mobile Suit and
﻿Armor work in tandem?

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.650
﻿What <i>is</i> that machine?

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:56.500
﻿In close combat, the one at a higher
﻿altitude holds an overwhelming advantage!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.710
﻿The Elf Bullock has greater maneuverability!

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:11.180
﻿How impudent!

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:16.890
﻿Captain Mask!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.350
﻿If I can't gain altitude on him,
﻿I can't take this to close combat!

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:25.400
﻿The backpack gets in the way of the rifle!

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.670
﻿There's air now.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.510
﻿How long has this water been in here?

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:54.220
﻿That light was an explosion.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.060
﻿Bell is there!

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:08.480
﻿Mick Jack!

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:11.070
﻿Your attacks are sloppy!
﻿You're letting them get away!

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:15.830
﻿I'll bet the Lieutenant is complaining.

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:18.870
﻿The beams won't focus!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:23.000
﻿You're pretty uppity for a flimsy little board!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:30.420
﻿Get lost, you flimsy little board!

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:40.890
﻿I can't win in close combat
﻿without raising my altitude.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:42.350
﻿Are you giving me support?

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:46.020
﻿If I can use a booster,

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:50.490
﻿I'll take down the G-Self here while it's
﻿still unaccustomed to the pink backpack.

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:57.490
﻿I can't get it to stabilize!

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:00.790
﻿Get it together!

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:03.290
The enemy still hasn't fled yet!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.880
﻿Weren't you supposed to
﻿be protecting your dad?

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:10.000
﻿I found out an unknown was approaching
﻿from the direction of Capital Tower.

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:11.510
﻿That's why I came out here.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:13.090
﻿An unknown?

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:15.220
﻿There's an unidentified machine
﻿coming this way, you mean?

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:19.100
﻿The Belay my father's on
﻿detected it with its camera.

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.690
﻿You can stop dragging the dummy balloon.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.980
﻿Support us in the Fry-Schop.

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:30.070
﻿- Roger!
﻿- Where is the unknown?

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:34.400
﻿Miss Aida, you're being reckless!

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.790
Are you people just messing around?!

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.290
﻿Your enemy is right here!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.960
﻿Wh-What?! A balloon!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.300
﻿What is this?!

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:05.850
﻿We couldn't stop him.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.270
﻿There was no way a balloon could have.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:09.610
﻿- A balloon?
﻿- Yes, a balloon.

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:12.730
﻿It doesn't look like there's anything
﻿wrong with this girl to me.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:16.320
﻿You're sure about the one coming from
﻿the direction of Capital Tower, right?

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.410
﻿I'm analyzing the image.

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:19.030
﻿It's glider size.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:22.080
﻿Then there's no need to intercept.

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:23.740
﻿Can't you have Aida come back?

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:26.160
﻿She always runs off without
﻿thinking, you know?

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:27.960
﻿Are you speaking ill of her?

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:30.750
﻿Lieutenant Klim says she's a valiant lady!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.500
﻿Bell! Bell! Bell!

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.760
﻿Oh, right. Bellri Zenam is with her, huh?

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:56.440
﻿Hmph, you can only fight while falling at me.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.340
﻿You're open!

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:25.890
﻿It took down the system!

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.810
﻿But that's only a temporary thing!

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:29.770
﻿What's an island doing there?!

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.330
﻿Mick Jack, well done!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:53.420
﻿﻿You too Lieutenant. I saw that
bulky pink G-Self let one get away.

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:54.920
﻿You can hear me, right?

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:58.090
﻿The Minovsky Particles have thinned out. Kid!

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:00.920
﻿The balance on this backpack's
﻿Minovsky Flight is—

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:03.050
﻿Ah! Miss Aida!

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:10.560
﻿Accelerate!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.140
﻿What is he suddenly having a fit over?

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:15.440
﻿That would be Miss Aida.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:17.520
﻿- Mick! Go after him!
- ﻿I can't!

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:21.030
﻿Both our machines are in bad shape.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.330
﻿Where is Miss Aida?

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:34.920
﻿I can't see her on the long-range
﻿monitor either. Where is she?

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:36.040
﻿I see her!

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.010
﻿The fins' output...!

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:43.970
﻿Why?! They're overloading!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:49.970
﻿I'm at a much higher altitude than
﻿the thing coming from Capital Tower!

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.310
﻿At this rate, I won't be
﻿able to make it back either.

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:01.690
﻿My radar's come back online!

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:03.990
﻿The G-Self is right below me!

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:07.070
﻿Is the unknown going to
﻿slip under me as well?

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:12.410
﻿The unknown is an atmospheric entry glider.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.080
﻿It's coming to me!

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:16.170
﻿Bell! Bell! Bell!

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:17.630
﻿Where's Bellri?!

00:14:17.630 --> 00:14:19.000
﻿- What?!
- ﻿Where are you?

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:21.000
﻿- Bell!
- ﻿Huh?!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.630
﻿It's your mother!

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.090
﻿My mother?!

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:29.680
﻿There's one glider. Where's Miss Aida?

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:36.270
﻿If my unit would just stabilize,
﻿I can take it down in one—

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:39.940
﻿Don't shoot it!

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:45.860
﻿- You're getting in my way!
- ﻿That's my mom!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.280
- Huh?
﻿- I'll stop it!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:52.030
﻿Use the reverse thrusters!
﻿You can brake, right?

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:56.330
﻿But...! But...! But...! But...!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:11.470
﻿So you're doing okay then?

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:15.470
﻿It was a Capital Tower
﻿emergency escape glider.

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:16.930
﻿Those can't do anything.

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:20.440
﻿I very nearly became a murderer.

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:26.440
﻿Huh? That's Bellri Zenam's mother?

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.610
﻿Mom.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:30.950
﻿You really did come down
﻿here alone in that glider.

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:34.450
﻿I came in a hurry, so I forgot
﻿to buy a cinnamon cake.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:39.420
﻿I thought the Crown timetable was
﻿the only thing you ever thought of.

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:42.790
﻿When things like this happen,
﻿yes, I worry for you a little.

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:44.920
﻿That's a Mobile Suit from
﻿the pirate ship, yes?

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.380
﻿Bellri Zenam, do you read me?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.970
﻿Yes, Aida Surugan.

00:15:48.970 --> 00:15:51.890
﻿We've checked for enemies.
﻿Let's return to the Megafauna.

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:53.050
﻿R-Right.

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:55.890
﻿Arcane, why were you doing that?

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:59.810
﻿I was checking for any enemies
﻿aside from the glider.

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.560
﻿Thank you for that.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.270
I lied.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.840
﻿I'd like you to try to persuade her as well!

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:31.130
﻿She's at the age where she's least
﻿likely to listen to adults, you know?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.220
﻿Oh, adolescence...

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:34.180
﻿Raraiya!

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:48.570
﻿It's fine! Lower your guns!
﻿It's the Crown operations director.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:56.200
﻿The operations director is Wilmit Zenam...

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.530
﻿His name is Bellri Zenam, right?

00:16:57.540 --> 00:17:01.080
﻿It's been since the Mettabal
﻿International Conference, hasn't it?

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.170
﻿I see you are the same as
﻿ever, Inspector General.

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.540
﻿Might that be your daughter?

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:08.550
﻿Yes, I am Aida Surugan.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:11.670
﻿I heard about your situation
﻿before coming down here.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:16.050
﻿I won't apologize for how you
﻿were treated at Capital Tower.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:18.010
﻿Of course not.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:19.930
﻿I must apologize.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.350
﻿For our space technology,

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:30.730
﻿we have borrowed from our enemy of
﻿the past 10 years, Gondwan as well.

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:35.200
﻿However, we have no connection to
﻿the Rose of Hermes Blueprints.

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:41.080
﻿What about the spaceship that led SU-Cordism
﻿to condemn you for taboo breaking?

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:44.250
﻿You mean the Nick Space, on which
﻿we halted construction?

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.460
﻿Yes.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:47.420
﻿That was dismantled.

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:50.380
﻿It should have been no issue at
﻿the international conference.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:54.170
﻿If the Nick Space is now the
﻿Megafauna, yes, it would be an issue.

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:56.970
﻿And how do you know it has?

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.050
﻿On many of the things in the ship,

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:00.890
﻿there are the names of various manufacturers,

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:02.720
﻿as well as dates of production.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:09.940
﻿You set the Nick Space up as a pirate
﻿ship to test it in the field.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.320
﻿Based on the data from that,

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:15.610
﻿you continued constructing a space
﻿fleet on the Amerian mainland, correct?

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:18.370
﻿If the threat from space
﻿becomes more concrete,

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:21.530
﻿you won't have time to take
﻿issue with us, you realize?

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:22.790
﻿Director.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.540
﻿We will be taking our leave.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.710
﻿We have maintenance and repairs to attend to.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:28.130
﻿Please, do.

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:30.380
﻿Have your mommy let you suckle her breasts.

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:32.090
﻿That's rude!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.920
﻿No shooting at us, okay?

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:39.510
﻿What's his problem?

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:44.680
﻿This is the truth.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.810
﻿Were these photographs taken from Ameria?

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:54.320
﻿Wait, that violates the taboo!
Astronomical observation isn't allowed!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:58.660
﻿There is heavy human
﻿activity around the moon.

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:04.240
﻿The work of the Kashiba Mikoshi,
﻿which brings us Photon Batteries,

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:06.960
﻿is the pulse of the universe itself.

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.380
﻿This is the Kashiba Mikoshi.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.590
﻿The number of other objects
﻿has increased in recent years.

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:18.220
﻿To deal with the threat presented
﻿by the other things around the moon,

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:22.300
﻿it is necessary to revive
﻿Universal Century era technology.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:26.640
﻿The reason that SU-Cordism distributes
﻿Photon Batteries to the Earth,

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:30.400
﻿is to help the humans who
﻿survived on Earth to rebuild.

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:31.900
﻿No matter what may happen,

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:34.400
﻿Capital Tower will stand
﻿rising into the sky!

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:36.360
﻿Mom, calm down.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:39.360
﻿Bell, Noredo, let's go home.

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:42.200
﻿Raraiya can come back to
﻿Capital Tower with us as well!

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.200
﻿Mom.

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.660
﻿If the Capital Army will accept it,

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.910
﻿I can spare one F-Rug for you.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:51.210
﻿Th-Thank you.

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.300
﻿We'll be crushed!

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:08.350
﻿That's the Captain's unit.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.480
﻿His name's Captain Mask, right?

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:14.230
﻿Reservists, pick up the fragments
﻿that fell on the deck!

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:16.440
﻿Don't miss a single piece!

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:21.450
<i>﻿I thought if I came to the front lines,</i>

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:25.700
<i>﻿I might be able to find out
﻿where Luin, Noredo, and Bell are.</i>

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.790
﻿He got half-wrecked.

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.410
﻿That's a Kuntala for you.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:31.250
﻿Kuntala will be Kuntala.

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.750
﻿Don't panic.

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.500
﻿I'll pass on your request to the
﻿operations staff officer.

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:39.090
﻿Take a rest for tonight.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:43.050
﻿Okay, troops, face right!

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.300
﻿Yes, sir!

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:47.260
﻿Each of you take what you picked
﻿up to the collections box.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.980
<i>﻿Huh? That's Luin Lee, isn't it?</i>

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:54.980
﻿Are they that happy to see a Kuntala fail?!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:59.070
﻿U-Using me like a guinea pig...

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:01.880
﻿You...

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:04.320
﻿I-I'm a Kuntala too!

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:11.750
﻿The shame I suffered from this defeat,

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:14.880
﻿as Captain Mask, I must clear myself of it.

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:16.000
﻿Y-Yes, sir!

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.210
﻿We Kuntala have our pride as well.

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:20.380
﻿Let me see that through for now.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:23.680
﻿Yes, sir! I'll be cheering
﻿for you Captain Mask!

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:24.970
﻿Thanks!

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:28.510
<i>﻿Luin is Mask.</i>

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:32.180
﻿Did you wake up?

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:37.230
﻿The Capital Army borrowed
﻿a spaceship from Gondwan.

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.900
﻿Did they?

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.980
﻿If they didn't, that unit must have...

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:44.820
﻿The colonel who investigated me,
﻿Cumpa Rusita...

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:47.780
﻿You mean Colonel Cumpa Rusita
﻿from the Research Division?

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:51.580
﻿There's no way he doesn't know about
﻿the Rose of Hermes Blueprints!

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:53.330
﻿I must speak to my father,
﻿to the Inspector General!

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:59.210
﻿You used an atmospheric entry
﻿glider by yourself, didn't you?

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:02.170
﻿Cheer up.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:05.260
﻿Capital Tower is an important
﻿transportation facility.

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:08.890
﻿It would never be destroyed from space.

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:11.680
﻿That is what His Holiness says.

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:03.170
﻿In order to return to
﻿Biclover in the Megafauna,

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:06.500
﻿we tried to avoid a Capital Army
﻿attack as we approached.

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:08.960
﻿Yet the Mask Corps still attacks us!

00:24:08.970 --> 00:24:13.130
﻿Because they attacked us when they didn't
﻿have to, Mask ends up in a crisis himself,

00:24:13.140 --> 00:24:15.680
﻿and I also get forced to do
﻿stuff I shouldn't have to.

00:24:15.680 --> 00:24:17.390
﻿Then, at the end of it all...

00:24:18.020 --> 00:24:20.350
﻿On the next episode of Reconguista in G,

00:24:20.350 --> 00:24:22.310
﻿The Megafauna Heads South.

00:24:22.310 --> 00:24:24.650
﻿If you don't watch, your life
﻿will be filled with darkness.
